1 NOTE
2 CONT November 9, 1999 - Bernice Iola Halverson, 91 of Austin, a retired Sears employee, died Wednesday, October 27, 1999 at Prairie Manor Nursing Home in Blooming Prairie.  Bernice Iola Bjorgo was born September 15, 1908 in Winneshiek 
2 CONC County, lived in Spring Grove and moved to Austin where she attended Austin High School.  She worked at the Austin Laundry before her marriage to Orville Halverson on March 15, 1931 in Owatonna.  Her husband died in 1988.  Mrs. Ha
2 CONC lvserson worked at the Sears Catalog Store in Austin from 1943 until her retirement in 1967.  She was a charter member of Our Savior's Lutheran Church and the Austin Does.  She enjoyed traveling, golf, hardanger and quilting and w
2 CONC as an avid reader.
2 CONT Survivors include a son Duane of Austin; three grandchildren and three great-grandchildren.  Three brothers preceded her in death.
2 CONT Funeral services were held October 30th at Our Savior's Lutheran Church in Austin with the Rev. Don Deines officiating.  Burial was in Grandview Cemetery in Austin.  Clasen-Jordan Mortuary in Austin was in charge of arrangements.
