1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born Nils Mathias Andersson Sekkingstad on 24 November 1887. Immigrated from Bergen to the United States aboard the Cunard line. Nils departed Norway 2 March 1906. His name was changed in the US (presumably at Elli
2 CONC s Island) from Nils Mathias Andersson Sekkingstad to Nels Mathias Anderson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Andersson was not a fixed last name, but a patronymic - in use in Norway until 1925. His father's name was Anders. Sekkingstad was his farm's name. Both the patronymic and the farm name were descriptors and not a surname in 
2 CONC the modern sense.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andersson and Andersen were used interchangeably. Local genealogists today use Andersson.
