2 CONT Andres L. “Andrew” Berge BIRTH	2 May 1866 Hole, Sandnes kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	10 Feb 1949 (aged 82) Stanley, Chippewa County, Wisconsin, USA BURIAL	 East Side Cemetery Clark County, Wisconsin, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Andres "Andrew" was born to Lars Larson Berge and Anne Rasmudotter Rage on May 2, 1866 in Roynli, Norway. He married Annie Sophie Onsager on March 12, 1893.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew and Sophie had six children. Lawrence, Albert, Anna Theresa, Robert, John Alfred and Alma Caroline.
